==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Noun===
{{en-plural noun}}

# The [[military]] [[force]]s of a [[nation]], such as the [[army]], [[navy]], [[air force]], [[marine]]s, and sometimes, [[coastguard]] or [[border guard]], which are tasked with the defence of the nation and its [[citizen]]s, if necessary through use of deadly force.
#* {{quote-journal|en|date=September 23, 2020|author=Shi Chuan|title=When Police Officers No Longer Work for Dictators|magazine=Minghui|url=http://en.minghui.org/html/articles/2020/9/23/186906.html|text=What dictators fear most is losing the support of the '''armed forces''', and when this happens, it's as if a ferocious beast has lost its teeth.}}

